Subject: [PATCH 3/5] stash: reuse diffs to check for changes

Checking for changes resulted in a full status, essentially repeating
later HEAD-to-index and index-to-workdir diffs. In most cases this can
be avoided by using the diffs up front.

Add regression tests for corner cases this code touches, namely
untracked and ignored files.
